list.json holds data of the SPDX License List: the id of each license with
its deprecated, OSI approved and FSF libre flags, and the id of each
license exception that is not deprecated.

Source:   SPDX License List, version 297da51, released 2026-01-30
          https://spdx.org/licenses/
          https://github.com/spdx/license-list-data, commit
          7e1f010ac88e4b8b58bc889e9a9bf42cf6624273,
          json/licenses.json and json/exceptions.json
Author:   The SPDX Legal Team, SPDX Workgroup, a Linux Foundation project
Licence:  Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported (CC-BY-3.0)
          https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/

Changes:  list.json keeps only the id and the three flags of each license,
          and the id of each active exception, sorted by id. It holds no
          license text and no other field.
          "go run ./policy/spdxlicense/internal/gen", run from the
          root of the module, writes it.
